1074+ 65D9 21 00 40         LD HL, $4000
1075+ 65DC 11 01 40         LD DE, $4001
1076+ 65DF 01 FF 17         LD BC, $17FF
1077+ 65E2 36 00            LD (HL), 0
1078+ 65E4 ED B0            LDIR
1079+ 65E6 21 00 58         LD HL, $5800
1080+ 65E9 11 01 58         LD DE, $5801
1081+ 65EC 01 FF 02         LD BC, $02FF
1082+ 65EF 36 00            LD (HL), $00                        ; ink black, paper black
1083+ 65F1 ED B0            LDIR
1084+ 65F3 C9               RET
