 292+ 6B21 3A E8 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 293+ 6B24 E6 F8            AND $F8
 294+ 6B26 F6 03            OR 3
 295+ 6B28 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 296+ 6B2B 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 297+ 6B2E ED 79            OUT (C), A
