 299+ 6B30 21 97 CC         LD HL, BgGfx_reloj_plaza + 2
 300+ 6B33 11 9B 8D         LD DE, PlazaClockPixels
 301+ 6B36 01 20 00         LD BC, 32
 302+ 6B39 ED B0            LDIR
 303+ 6B3B                  ; Page bank 0 inline
 304+ 6B3B 3A E8 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 305+ 6B3E E6 F8            AND $F8
 306+ 6B40 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 307+ 6B43 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 308+ 6B46 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 309+ 6B48 3A 4A 81         LD A, (StartupComplete)
 310+ 6B4B B7               OR A
 311+ 6B4C 28 01            JR Z, .lpcpNoEI                 ; aun en Inicio -> dejar DI
