 314+ 6F29              ; ==============================================================================
 315+ 6F29              ; UpdateRandomPickup - room-enter hook
 316+ 6F29              ; ==============================================================================
 317+ 6F29              ; Llamado por MainLoop entre CheckScreenTransition y DrawScreen, cada frame.
 318+ 6F29              ; Early-out si ScreenDirty=0 (no transition).
 319+ 6F29              ;
 320+ 6F29              ; En transition:
 321+ 6F29              ;   1. Recorre el BG stream de la sala actual (CurrentScreenAddr) buscando
 322+ 6F29              ;      placements id=RANDOM_SLOT_MARKER. Acumula (charX, charY) en RandomSlotList.
 323+ 6F29              ;   2. Si count > 0: RNG slot, RNG tipo. Si tipo != none, rellena
 324+ 6F29              ;      RandomSyntheticEntry con la pickup elegida en la posicion del slot.
 325+ 6F29              ;      Si tipo == none o count == 0, marca inactiva ($FE).
 326+ 6F29              ;
 327+ 6F29              ; Buffer format (CurrentScreenAddr → CurrentScreenBuffer): entries de 4 bytes
 328+ 6F29              ; fijos (id, charX, charY, v) terminados con id=$FF.
 329+ 6F29              ;
 330+ 6F29              ; Destruye AF, BC, DE, HL.
 331+ 6F29              ; ==============================================================================
 332+ 6F29              UpdateRandomPickup:
 333+ 6F29 3A B6 82         LD A, (ScreenDirty)
 334+ 6F2C B7               OR A
 335+ 6F2D C8               RET Z
