 345+ 7361              .pmcaDirToOffset:
 346+ 7361 01               DEFB $01                             ; 0 (N) → col 2 row 1 → +1
 347+ 7362 20               DEFB $20                             ; 1 (S) → col 1 row 2 → +$20
