  58+ 9BED 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  59+ 9BF0 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  60+ 9BF3 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  61+ 9BF5 CD 4A E5         CALL AY_UpdateBellImpl
  62+ 9BF8 3A E8 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  63+ 9BFB E6 F8            AND $F8
  64+ 9BFD 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  65+ 9C00 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  66+ 9C03 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  67+ 9C05 FB               EI
  68+ 9C06 C9               RET
