  80+ 9C1A 3A E8 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  81+ 9C1D E6 F8            AND $F8
  82+ 9C1F 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  83+ 9C22 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  84+ 9C25 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  85+ 9C27 FB               EI
