 101+ 9C3F E6 F8            AND $F8
 102+ 9C41 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 103+ 9C44 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 104+ 9C47 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 105+ 9C49 FB               EI
 106+ 9C4A C9               RET
