  53+ 9D45                  ; paginado (p. ej. monster_ai durante BFS), no nos llama aqui.
  54+ 9D45 3A E8 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  55+ 9D48 E6 F8            AND $F8
  56+ 9D4A 32 E8 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  57+ 9D4D 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  58+ 9D50 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  59+ 9D52 C9               RET
