 509+ A400                  ; === STATE_RUNNING ===
 510+ A400                  ; Auto-transicion: nasty/monster + ScareTimer activo → STATE_SCARED
 511+ A400 3A 04 B9         LD A, (ScareTimer)
 512+ A403 B7               OR A
