1846+ AC7E                  ; Prioridad: E/W sobre N/S
1847+ AC7E CB 57            BIT 2, A
1848+ AC80 20 0C            JR NZ, .runE
1849+ AC82 CB 5F            BIT 3, A
1850+ AC84 20 10            JR NZ, .runW
1851+ AC86 CB 47            BIT 0, A
1852+ AC88 20 14            JR NZ, .runN
