1883+ ACB0 FE 1B            CP SPRID_ATTACK_WEST
1884+ ACB2 20 58            JR NZ, .noPushBack
1885+ ACB4
1886+ ACB4                  ; Attack west: comprobar X-8 en fila superior e inferior → mover +8
1887+ ACB4 D5               PUSH DE
1888+ ACB5 C5               PUSH BC
1889+ ACB6 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1890+ ACB9 D6 08            SUB 8
1891+ ACBB 47               LD B, A
