1962+ AD32
1963+ AD32                  ; Timer expirado → avanzar frame
1964+ AD32 DD 71 09         LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), C    ; Reset timer
1965+ AD35
1966+ AD35                  ; Paso: si el player esta corriendo, reproducir "tic-tac" alternado
1967+ AD35 DD 7E 02         LD A, (IX+ENT_STATE)
1968+ AD38 FE 01            CP STATE_RUNNING
1969+ AD3A 20 17            JR NZ, .noFootstep
1970+ AD3C 3A EB 90         LD A, (FootstepToggle)
1971+ AD3F EE 01            XOR 1
1972+ AD41 32 EB 90         LD (FootstepToggle), A
