2147+ AE18              .cwDoCheck:
2148+ AE18                  ; AABB con margen de 8px (1 celda) por cada lado:
2149+ AE18                  ; playerX < wellX+24 AND wellX-8 < playerX+16
2150+ AE18                  ; playerY < wellY+24 AND wellY-8 < playerY+21
2151+ AE18                  ; --- Check X ---
