2173+ AE41 4F               LD C, A
2174+ AE42 3A BF 90         LD A, (WellPosY)                    ; A = wellY
2175+ AE45 B9               CP C                                ; wellY < playerBottom+margen?
2176+ AE46 30 18            JR NC, .cwNoOverlap                 ; no → fuera
