3571+ B636 38 07            JR C, .moCpYCheck2
3572+ B638 5F               LD E, A
3573+ B639 DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
3574+ B63C BB               CP E
3575+ B63D 30 0E            JR NC, .moCpOk                      ; monY >= playerY + 21 → no overlap
3576+ B63F              .moCpYCheck2:
