3665+ B6AC 32 F5 B8         LD (.flHDist), A
3666+ B6AF 79               LD A, C
3667+ B6B0 32 F6 B8         LD (.flHDx), A
3668+ B6B3
3669+ B6B3                  ; --- Borde vertical mas cercano ---
3670+ B6B3 DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
