3675+ B6BE B8               CP B
3676+ B6BF 30 07            JR NC, .flTopNear
3677+ B6C1 47               LD B, A
3678+ B6C2 3A BB 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
3679+ B6C5 4F               LD C, A                         ; → abajo
3680+ B6C6 18 06            JR .flVDone
3681+ B6C8              .flTopNear:
3682+ B6C8 3A BB 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
3683+ B6CB ED 44            NEG
3684+ B6CD 4F               LD C, A                         ; → arriba
3685+ B6CE              .flVDone:
3686+ B6CE 78               LD A, B
3687+ B6CF 32 F7 B8         LD (.flVDist), A
3688+ B6D2 79               LD A, C
3689+ B6D3 32 F8 B8         LD (.flVDy), A
