4259+ B9DD 0F               RRCA
4260+ B9DE 0F               RRCA
4261+ B9DF 0F               RRCA
4262+ B9E0 E6 1F            AND $1F
4263+ B9E2 32 53 BA         LD (.ecXlo), A                  ; charXlo
4264+ B9E5 7A               LD A, D
