4608+ BB99 32 9A BC         LD (.spawnSeed), A
4609+ BB9C 47               LD B, A
4610+ BB9D ED 5F            LD A, R
4611+ BB9F A8               XOR B
4612+ BBA0 E6 78            AND $78
