5477+ C062
5478+ C062              ; ==============================================================================
5479+ C062              ; MONSTER SPAWN/REPOSITION SYSTEM (simplified, robust)
5480+ C062              ; ==============================================================================
5481+ C062              ; ALL monsters ALWAYS appear at LastEntryPosX/Y (player's entry position).
5482+ C062              ; This is the ONLY guaranteed safe position (player fits there, 16x21).
5483+ C062              ; No nudge, no border scan, no MonsterSave, no buffer restore.
5484+ C062              ; ==============================================================================
5485+ C062              ; MONSTER SPAWN/REPOSITION SYSTEM (robust, simplified)
5486+ C062              ; ==============================================================================
5487+ C062              ; ALL monsters ALWAYS appear at LastEntryPosX/Y (player entry position).
5488+ C062              ; This is the ONLY guaranteed safe position (player fits 16x21 there).
5489+ C062              ; No nudge, no border scan, no MonsterSave, no buffer restore.
5490+ C062              ; ==============================================================================
5491+ C062              MONSTERS_TO_SPAWN   EQU 3
5492+ C062              MONSTER_ENTRY_BASE  EQU 20          ; Frames antes del primer monster (~0.8s a 25fps)
5493+ C062              MONSTER_ENTRY_GAP   EQU 20          ; Frames entre cada monster (~0.8s)
