 112+ D012 3A 5B 82         LD A, (InputDirection)
 113+ D015 57               LD D, A                     ; D = input direction (bits 0-3: N S E W)
 114+ D016
 115+ D016                  ; --- Comprobar borde OESTE (solo si pulsa W) ---
