2250+ DADC AF               XOR A
2251+ DADD 32 52 E5         LD (BgSpriteIsHouse), A
2252+ DAE0 CD AE DE         CALL DrawBgAttrOnly
2253+ DAE3 C3 06 DD         JP BuildPickupRectCache             ; pickup spawneado in-place: rebuild + clear dirty
2254+ DAE6              .rpbpSkipInactive:
