 126+ ED4A              UpdateGameClock:
 127+ ED4A 3A 63 82         LD A, (TimeFrozen)
 128+ ED4D B7               OR A
 129+ ED4E C0               RET NZ                          ; tiempo congelado mientras encierras monstruos
 130+ ED4F 21 B0 EB         LD HL, GameSubMinute
 131+ ED52 34               INC (HL)
 132+ ED53 3A B3 EB         LD A, (SubMinuteMax)
 133+ ED56 BE               CP (HL)
 134+ ED57 C0               RET NZ
 135+ ED58
 136+ ED58 AF               XOR A
 137+ ED59 32 B0 EB         LD (GameSubMinute), A
 138+ ED5C 21 B1 EB         LD HL, GameMinutes
 139+ ED5F 34               INC (HL)
 140+ ED60                  ; NOTA: el spawn de monsters ahora se dispara tras las campanadas
 141+ ED60                  ; (cadena diferida en UpdateBellsDoneTimer), no a las 00:30.
 142+ ED60 3A B1 EB         LD A, (GameMinutes)
 143+ ED63 FE 3C            CP 60
 144+ ED65 C0               RET NZ
 145+ ED66
 146+ ED66 AF               XOR A
 147+ ED67 32 B1 EB         LD (GameMinutes), A
 148+ ED6A 21 B2 EB         LD HL, GameHours
 149+ ED6D 34               INC (HL)
 150+ ED6E 7E               LD A, (HL)
 151+ ED6F FE 18            CP 24
 152+ ED71 20 04            JR NZ, .checkPhase
 153+ ED73 AF               XOR A
 154+ ED74 32 B2 EB         LD (GameHours), A
