 659+ F3BD 32 6A 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A
 660+ F3C0              .dcSkipPrevDistSave:
 661+ F3C0 3A AE 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
 662+ F3C3 32 6B 82         LD (LastCompassScreenX), A
 663+ F3C6 3A AF 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
 664+ F3C9 32 6C 82         LD (LastCompassScreenY), A
