 718+ F3F8 77               LD (HL), A
 719+ F3F9 21 38 58         LD HL, $5800 + (COMPASS_CHARROW + 1) * $20 + COMPASS_COL
 720+ F3FC 77               LD (HL), A
 721+ F3FD 23               INC HL
 722+ F3FE 77               LD (HL), A
 723+ F3FF C9               RET
 724+ F400
