1107+ F583              ; a CHURCH_CUTSCENE_TOTAL_FRAMES, dispara ApplyChurchTrapEffects + termina.
1108+ F583              ; (MVP1: solo freeze + reposicion; sin shake. MVP2 anadira jitter visible.)
1109+ F583              ; ==============================================================================
1110+ F583              UpdateChurchCutscene:
1111+ F583 3A 73 82         LD A, (ChurchCutscenePhase)
