1623+ F826              ; ==============================================================================
1624+ F826              ; WobblePhaseTable - 9 fases del wobble (1 frame cada una, 9 frames total).
1625+ F826              ; Indexada por (counter-1) -> 0..8. Valor:
1626+ F826              ;   0 = prev2, 1 = prev, 2 = target, 3 = next, 4 = next2.
1627+ F826              ; Con counter inicial 9 y decremento por frame:
1628+ F826              ;   counter 9 -> phase 8 -> prev2  (primer estado al entrar a la sala)
1629+ F826              ;   counter 8 -> phase 7 -> prev
1630+ F826              ;   counter 7 -> phase 6 -> target
1631+ F826              ;   counter 6 -> phase 5 -> next
1632+ F826              ;   counter 5 -> phase 4 -> next2
1633+ F826              ;   counter 4 -> phase 3 -> prev
1634+ F826              ;   counter 3 -> phase 2 -> target
1635+ F826              ;   counter 2 -> phase 1 -> prev
1636+ F826              ;   counter 1 -> phase 0 -> target (estado final, settle)
1637+ F826              ; ==============================================================================
1638+ F826              WobblePhaseTable:
1639+ F826 02 01 02 01      DEFB 2, 1, 2, 1, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0
